                        <span class="tag-stamp tag-dark"><i class="fas fa-robot text-warning"></i></span>
                        <h5 class="modal-title font-display mb-0" id="assistantModalLabel">IOAS Chatbot Terminal</h5>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-2">
                        Simulate the conversational assistant, or chat directly with the live bot on Telegram:
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://t.me/IOAS_AlertBot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-funky btn-funky-lime btn-sm mb-3 w-100 text-center text-decoration-none">
                        <i class="fab fa-telegram me-1"></i> Chat with @IOAS_AlertBot on Telegram
                    </a>
                    
                    <div id="chatStream" class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3 p-3 bg-light rounded border border-2 border-dark" style="max-height: 280px; overflow-y: auto;">
                        <div class="chat-bubble-bot">
                            👋 Hi! I'm the IOAS assistant. Ask me:
                            <br>• <em>"What AI hackathons are coming up?"</em>
                            <br>• <em>"Are there any Scopus conferences?"</em>
                            <br>• <em>"subscribe AI, Web3"</em>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap mb-3">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-dark fw-bold rounded-pill text-xs px-2 py-0 suggestion-pill" data-prompt="Show upcoming hackathons">Hackathons</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-dark fw-bold rounded-pill text-xs px-2 py-0 suggestion-pill" data-prompt="List Scopus conferences">Conferences</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-dark fw-bold rounded-pill text-xs px-2 py-0 suggestion-pill" data-prompt="subscribe AI, Machine Learning">Subscribe AI</button>
                    </div>

                    <form id="chatForm" class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <input type="text" id="chatInput" class="form-control form-control-funky" placeholder="Ask a question or type 'subscribe ...'" required>
